{"parse":{"text":"<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru inf-form-of\">осе́сть</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru past&#124;act&#124;part-form-of\">осе́вший</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru past&#124;adv&#124;part-form-of\">осе́в</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 1&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ося́ду</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ося́дешь</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 3&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ося́дет</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 1&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ося́дем</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ося́дете</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 3&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ося́дут</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;s&#124;imp-form-of\">ося́дь</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;p&#124;imp-form-of\">ося́дьте</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru m&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">осе́л</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru p&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">осе́ли</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru f&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">осе́ла</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru n&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">осе́ло</i>\n<abbr title=\"perfective aspect\">\nindeclinable"}}